{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午11時許，港島香港仔南寧街一間超級市場冒出濃煙，多名途人見狀報案求助。消防員接報趕赴現場時，已經無煙無火。據報是上址一間超級市場的廚房起火。火警中無人受傷，亦無須疏散。警方及消防正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"港島香港仔南寧街一間超級市場的後方冒出濃煙，多名途人見狀報案求助。（Ella Q Hi圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188460799728160768349160.jpeg/nAl4Fjkqnx9B7ztwzOkSEebpsaFibs-PZI0DDmSNAw4\"/><figcaption>港島香港仔南寧街一間超級市場的後方冒出濃煙，多名途人見狀報案求助。（Ella Q Hi圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員及警員接報到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188460797265973248901763.jpeg/U7Hyy9xBV4Uv4JQQkAWJ_v9byul8M7IdIrWwpyK1sKc\"/><figcaption>消防員及警員接報到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員接報趕抵到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188460794933809152129346.jpeg/YzqIxM2o9pvk3yc1CKPgY6LC-Je6mmvn8bcKN_G3Cjc\"/><figcaption>消防員接報趕抵到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員接報趕抵到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188460792018636800280453.jpeg/H12a148MTaxrQ2623OSRDavaRDGz3aGFd8vciHfL3Ig\"/><figcaption>消防員接報趕抵到場。（Ella Q Hi圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:58:38.252289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:33:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:03:20.585362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:57:33.965737+00:00","content_hash":"c1e02ef98f8973501cedde8c14bab91ed5797b904f0c2a9b11be9d5d1997225e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}